{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487211-bloodlines-2-still-exist-according-to-paradox","id":1487211,"title":"Bloodlines 2 still exist according to Paradox","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-20T11:12:20-07:00","id":1487211,"title":"Bloodlines 2 still exist according to Paradox","content":"<a href=\"https://www.gamedeveloper.com/production/paradox-ceo-vampire-bloodlines-2-development-updat\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.gamedeveloper.com/produc...elopment-updat</a><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-size:16px\">In 2021, publisher Paradox Interactive announced that Vampire: The Masquerade--Bloodlines 2 would be <a href=\"https://www.gamedeveloper.com/business/paradox-removes-hardsuit-labs-as-i-bloodlines-2-i-developer-title-delayed-indefinitely\" target=\"_blank\">indefinitely delayed</a> after removing developer Hardsuit Labs from the project. Now, CEO Fredrik Wester took to Twitter to declare the sequel remains in active development.&quot;It's in good hands,&quot; Wester <a href=\"https://twitter.com/TheWesterFront/status/1549347843441364992?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1549347843441364992%7Ctwgr%5E%7Ctwcon%5Es1_&amp;ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.videogameschronicle.com%2Fnews%2Fparadox-says-bloodlines-2-is-in-good-hands-but-wont-be-shown-at-pdxcon-2022%2F\" target=\"_blank\">tweeted</a>. &quot;We look forward to showing you more when the team and the game is ready.&quot;<br /> <br /> Despite that update, he added that the game <a href=\"https://twitter.com/TheWesterFront/status/1549407327694065665?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1549407327694065665%7Ctwgr%5E%7Ctwcon%5Es1_&amp;ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.videogameschronicle.com%2Fnews%2Fparadox-says-bloodlines-2-is-in-good-hands-but-wont-be-shown-at-pdxcon-2022%2F\" target=\"_blank\">would not be featured</a> at Paradox's annual PDXCon event taking place in September. Beyond that, Wester gave no other information on the game, such as which specific studio has taken over developer duties from Hardsuit.<br /> <br /> <b>Bloodlines 2's development woes run deep</b><br /> <br /> Last year, following Bloodlines' delay, Paradox said the choice to hire a new developer was a &quot;difficult decision,&quot; but necessary to &quot;do the game justice.&quot;<br /> <br /> Months later, Wester admitted the sequel was close to becoming <a href=\"https://www.videogameschronicle.com/news/vampire-the-masquerade-bloodlines-2-was-almost-cancelled-paradox-reveals/\" target=\"_blank\">completely canceled</a>. But the pitch given to them by the game's currently unknown developer &quot;was convincing enough to run...we have very good hopes that it will be a good game that meets the players\u2019 expectations.\u201d<br /> <br /> Developed by Troika Games, the original Vampire: The Masquerade--Bloodlines released in 2004 and became a cult classic. Bloodlines 2was revealed in March 2019 with an expected 2020 release. It would later be delayed to 2021, during which Paradox and Hardsuit <a href=\"https://www.gamedeveloper.com/business/paradox-hardsuit-labs-fire-two-creative-leads-on-i-bloodlines-2-i-\" target=\"_blank\">fired </a>both its creative director Ka'ai Clunkey and lead narrative director Brian Mitsoda in 2020.<br /> <br /> At the time, Mitsoda explained to <a href=\"https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/brian-mitsoda-has-been-fired-as-narrative-lead-on-bloodlines-2\" target=\"_blank\">Rock Paper Shotgun</a> that he wasn't involved in conversations about the game's original delay, which was partially contributed to the early days of the COVID-19 pandemic.</span></i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T11:36:12-07:00","id":1487218,"title":"","content":"Well, I wish all the best<br /> Even if I don't expect it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T11:39:46-07:00","id":1487220,"title":"","content":"What a colossal clusterfuck, still hoping it will turn good...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T11:51:05-07:00","id":1487223,"title":"","content":"Assuming I still have a computer (which might be a bigger <i>if</i> than I'm comfortable with) when, or if, it comes out, I will probably get it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T15:44:37-07:00","id":1487263,"title":"","content":"Frankly, I am very curious how much this game is being changed and how much of the original set up is going to remain. Are they remaking it from the ground up or &quot;finishing&quot; it?<br /> <br /> Also, Chris Avellone's blog said the game was almost done before the scandal involving him (and apparently also Brian Mitsoda going to the bat for him) resulted in them removing their content. Which was, of course, the entirety of the main story since they were the driving creative forces. I hope they restored that.<br /> <br /> Bloodlines IS Mitsoda's baby and no one else can do it right.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 07-20-2022, 07:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T16:21:59-07:00","id":1487270,"title":"","content":"Yeah, if they don't restore Avellone's and especially, Mitsoda's writing the game will be dead on arrival to me and I simply won't be picking it up, at least not until it's like $1 on a Steam sale four or five years down the road. And looking on places like reddit and other Bloodlines communities, that seems to be the general sentiment. Having Mitsoda come back as the lead writer was the reason that so many people got interested in the game in the first place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T16:28:27-07:00","id":1487273,"title":"","content":"Here's a link to Chris Avellone's blog and what happened, BTW:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://chrisavellone.medium.com/what-the-fuck-happened-to-bloodlines-2-1ad557bf2284\" target=\"_blank\">https://chrisavellone.medium.com/wha...2-1ad557bf2284</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T00:16:00-07:00","id":1487318,"title":"","content":"I'm guessing Hardsuit Labs deleted everything written by Mitsoda and Avellone before turning the data over. Paradox got it awhile ago but there's been no mention of Avellone or Mitsoda. Avellone still has &quot;ex-Bloodlines 2&quot; on his Twitter account. If Paradox had gotten in contact with him about the possibility of restoring his content he would have at least posted a vague Bloodlines related tweet to give the fans hope, without actually breaking any NDA's. But he hasn't done that. And Paradox hasn't given fans any reason to hope.<br /> <br /> So I'm guessing that at this point, whatever form Bloodlines 2 takes, it will have nothing to do with those two.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T00:33:53-07:00","id":1487319,"title":"","content":"I'm not so invested in specific creators. Bloodlines 2 can be a great game without two specific writers... VtM has changed hands plenty of times. But the new team should be aware of the fans here, and make sure to do not try to do too much referencing to the two (VtR 1e suffered a lot from fans not liking all the VtM references), but not ignoring them at the same time. It'll be a tough balancing act.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T00:51:20-07:00","id":1487321,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487211-bloodlines-2-still-exist-according-to-paradox?p=1487319#post1487319\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> VtM has changed hands plenty of times. But the new team should be aware of the fans here, .</div> </div> </div> </div>Are they? I made a realization a couple of months ago: V20's decline happened a bit after Paradox took the helm, and now there's V5, a divisive product to say the least. Paradox has released some great titles especially in the field of RPGs, Strategy and many other politically minded games, but their work on VtM has been... less than exemplary. With the state of the tabletop game being what it is, and the messy drama we're seeing here, how can we expect a game that pleases fans, or more concerningly, the general audience?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T00:53:08-07:00","id":1487322,"title":"","content":"In general, taking the litter and dropping it into the river never really puts much confidence into the persons that thought this was a good idea. The way they dropped everything and decided to get a new developer without much explanation or preparation just means this is costing a lot of money and going nowhere. Looking at how much they also stopped talking about it, this will most likely be long delayed. I wonder if it will take longer to get a Bloodlines game than it took Duke Nukem Forever...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T01:13:29-07:00","id":1487327,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487211-bloodlines-2-still-exist-according-to-paradox?p=1487322#post1487322\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In general, taking the litter and dropping it into the river never really puts much confidence into the persons that thought this was a good idea. The way they dropped everything and decided to get a new developer without much explanation or preparation just means this is costing a lot of money and going nowhere. Looking at how much they also stopped talking about it, this will most likely be long delayed. I wonder if it will take longer to get a Bloodlines game than it took Duke Nukem Forever...</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, they dropped the developer after the developer fired their main story people and went from being on target to finish the game then being nowhere near completion.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T01:28:14-07:00","id":1487331,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487211-bloodlines-2-still-exist-according-to-paradox?p=1487321#post1487321\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are they?</div> </div> </div> </div>Who knows? It's not like we know anything about the Bloodlines 2 team. Hence my phrasing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I made a realization a couple of months ago: V20's decline happened a bit after Paradox took the helm, and now there's V5, a divisive product to say the least. </div> </div> </div>That's not really fair. Onyx Path was planning on ending V20 before Paradox bought the WoD IP. Rich and Eddy were openly discussing a new VtM edition for the 21st century before Martin and friends swooped in to do it their way with V5. V20's &quot;decline&quot; was because it was a nostalgia edition that had covered almost all of the old material on some level and more would be C&amp;P or rewrites of books that still hold up in V20. I think we can all acknowledge that a V20 Book of Nod would be hard to see as adding much if it was just the old Book of Nod with a new cover and another layer of margin notes.<br /> <br /> You know I don't like how V5 was done, but that doesn't mean the idea was bad.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> With the state of the tabletop game being what it is, and the messy drama we're seeing here, how can we expect a game that pleases fans, or more concerningly, the general audience? </div> </div> </div>Are we talking about the TTRPG books or the video game? Because Bloodlines 2 has a whole host of problems, but worrying about the state of the TT books is not one.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487211-bloodlines-2-still-exist-according-to-paradox?p=1487322#post1487322\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if it will take longer to get a Bloodlines game than it took Duke Nukem Forever...</div> </div> </div> </div>Bloodlines 2 was always going to be in that position. There was a 15 year gap between the last original Duke Nukem release and Duke Nukem Forever. Bloodlines 1 came out in 2004, so.... 2019 was the year to tie Duke Nukem Forever.<br /> <br /> The difference is that Duke Nukem Forever was &quot;in development&quot; almost that whole time, while Bloodlines 2 wasn't announced until after Paradox bought things. That said, if Bloodlines 2 goes absolutely smoothly from here on, it'll be five years from announcement to release at a minimum, and more likely closer to six.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T01:47:18-07:00","id":1487333,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487211-bloodlines-2-still-exist-according-to-paradox?p=1487263#post1487263\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Frankly, I am very curious how much this game is being changed and how much of the original set up is going to remain. Are they remaking it from the ground up or &quot;finishing&quot; it?</div> </div> </div> </div>The most probable answer by the looks of it is that they're remaking it from the ground up, and I hope it is this.<br /> <br /> Sure, just finishing the game would take far less time. But it is also the easiest way to end up with a messy product they can't afford to deliver anymore. I sincerely think that dumping the whole title by now would be a better option than releasing a half-assed game with too many devs and too little oversight.<br /> <br /> But in all seriousness, Paradox shouldn't have focused so much on Bloodlines 2 so soon, no matter how much the fans want it. They should just played their own strength instead of trying to pull this whole cross-media shenanigans with little direct involvement and dubious IP strategies.<br /> <br /> Paradox is first and foremost a games publisher specialized in Strategy games with political aspects. <b>And they're good at it, dammit! </b>they have several good titles and have a history in the market, even if previously as a small developer. They have currently 9 studios, only one of them is not a game studio. They simply never touched the IP to just do their own thing.<br /> <br /> Why not just do a DAV-based Strategy game? That would have been a good enough start to their business with the WoD IP.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T01:51:38-07:00","id":1487334,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487211-bloodlines-2-still-exist-according-to-paradox?p=1487333#post1487333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The most probable answer by the looks of it is that they're remaking it from the ground up, and I hope it is this.<br /> <br /> Sure, just finishing the game would take far less time. But it is also the easiest way to end up with a messy product they can't afford to deliver anymore. I sincerely think that dumping the whole title by now would be a better option than releasing a half-assed game with too many devs and too little oversight.<br /> <br /> But in all seriousness, Paradox shouldn't have focused so much on Bloodlines 2 so soon, no matter how much the fans want it. They should just played their own strength instead of trying to pull this whole cross-media shenanigans with little direct involvement and dubious IP strategies.<br /> <br /> Paradox is first and foremost a games publisher specialized in Strategy games with political aspects. <b>And they're good at it, dammit! </b>they have several good titles and have a history in the market, even if previously as a small developer. They have currently 9 studios, only one of them is not a game studio. They simply never touched the IP to just do their own thing.<br /> <br /> Why not just do a DAV-based Strategy game? That would have been a good enough start to their business with the WoD IP.</div> </div> </div> </div>They actually have a DA Vampire total mod for Crusader Kings as I understand it.<br /> <br /> But if you're buying an IP primarily about roleplaying and personal horror, you should make an IP about roleplaying and personal horror.<br /> <br /> The strategy they had was also genius as they hired two of the best guys in RPG writing to make the game with a passion for the project.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T03:25:57-07:00","id":1487344,"title":"","content":"The problem is that it wasn't genius because nWW and Paradox severely erred in their estimation of where the IP was in the mainstream, and how to best go about reestablishing it there.<br /> <br /> &quot;Flood every bit of gaming media we can with WoD stuff,&quot; is not genius because it is obviously a bad idea. The brand needed a lot of work before it could really sell as a transmedia entity. Paradox also seems to have seriously miscalculated how much brand loyalty and goodwill would transfer to them just for buy the WoD from CCP and wanting to make it more than just a new skin n an existing product.<br /> <br /> Continuing to try to borrow clout by hiring names fans recognize is also not being leveraged properly to call it genius. You can't bring on a name to make the game that, banking on the fans' love of that name's previous work, isn't what that name would make. If you announce that we can trust Bloodlines 2 is going to be a quality successor to Bloodlines 1 because Mitsoda is leading the team on it, but your plan isn't flexible enough to actually let Mitsoda do his work within your framework? That's not a genius plan, that's a shit plan. That results in exactly this: delays and upset fans.<br /> <br /> There is a massive gap between a genius strategy and a genius idea: good planning. You can have completely impractical genius ideas that never go anywhere. You can't have a genius strategy that's doomed to failure because it was always impractical.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T03:28:41-07:00","id":1487345,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487211-bloodlines-2-still-exist-according-to-paradox?p=1487344#post1487344\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The problem is that it wasn't genius because nWW and Paradox severely erred in their estimation of where the IP was in the mainstream, and how to best go about reestablishing it there.<br /> <br /> &quot;Flood every bit of gaming media we can with WoD stuff,&quot; is not genius because it is obviously a bad idea. The brand needed a lot of work before it could really sell as a transmedia entity. Paradox also seems to have seriously miscalculated how much brand loyalty and goodwill would transfer to them just for buy the WoD from CCP and wanting to make it more than just a new skin n an existing product.<br /> <br /> Continuing to try to borrow clout by hiring names fans recognize is also not being leveraged properly to call it genius. You can't bring on a name to make the game that, banking on the fans' love of that name's previous work, isn't what that name would make. If you announce that we can trust Bloodlines 2 is going to be a quality successor to Bloodlines 1 because Mitsoda is leading the team on it, but your plan isn't flexible enough to actually let Mitsoda do his work within your framework? That's not a genius plan, that's a shit plan. That results in exactly this: delays and upset fans.<br /> <br /> There is a massive gap between a genius strategy and a genius idea: good planning. You can have completely impractical genius ideas that never go anywhere. You can't have a genius strategy that's doomed to failure because it was always impractical.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't blame Paradox Interactive for what happened to Mitsoda or Avellone who was as passionate about the game as him as well as one of the chief driving forces. I'm pretty much of the mind that Hardsuit Labs got fired from the project for justifiable reasons. It's usually the underdog that we side with on this but everything we know about the story indicates that they really screwed things up.<br /> <br /> But they made a move to shut down the project versus making an inferior product or vaporware for years to come, which puts them over CD Projekt Red and Cyberpunk 2077 that was the OTHER game that everyone was looking forward to that year.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T03:59:32-07:00","id":1487349,"title":"","content":"I didn't assign blame. I pointed out that the strategy was too flawed to call genius.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T04:59:50-07:00","id":1487364,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487211-bloodlines-2-still-exist-according-to-paradox?p=1487334#post1487334\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> But if you're buying an IP primarily about roleplaying and personal horror, you should make an IP about roleplaying and personal horror.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>People say it's personal horror, but naturally falls into political horror. The scary thing is Politics, having power to abuse, and having to live a lie. Drinking blood and Beastial episodes might be devastating at first but it isn't exactly something that's going to phase you after six months. The worst part of being a Vampire is that the sun is usually out around 3/4ths of the time and so you really don't get that much out of each day.<br /> <br /> Look at, say, The Boys (The TV show of course)<br /> Becoming a super is great<br /> How that that power effects how people behave is terrifying.<br /> How nothing can be done so people become wilfully ignorant is terrifying.<br /> I wouldn't be surprised if S4 had a bit of -Hey, rich man, want to be part of the new world order? Support super heroes, and we'll juice up your kids-<br /> <br /> The Vampire parallels are obvious. Were the masquerade to break, this'd happen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T19:45:29-07:00","id":1487438,"title":"","content":"In V5 you're already starting to see that with wealthy techbros essentially paying to become vampires and thinbloods.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T20:26:03-07:00","id":1487439,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487211-bloodlines-2-still-exist-according-to-paradox?p=1487334#post1487334\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But if you're buying an IP primarily about roleplaying and personal horror, you should make an IP about roleplaying and personal horror.<br /> <br /> The strategy they had was also genius as they hired two of the best guys in RPG writing to make the game with a passion for the project.</div> </div> </div> </div>It was not genius. It was stupid.<br /> <br /> They committed one of the biggest sins in business strategy: do not play against your core business.<br /> <br /> As a company they have everything about their kind of games. They know the market, they know the competition, they know the work force. They know the internal culture if similar companies and the people they deal with. They know the ins and outs of target marketing and viable sources. Their HR is capable to identify potential and problems. They know what they're doing and they have a well-oiled machine to do it. Because this machine does it regularly and have been doing it for years to great success.<br /> <br /> Why not buy the IP and then let OPP do their thing? Instead of poking their noses in it, they should have taken their time to get acquainted to the IP, not as fans, but as a company. During this time, use it the way they know, play their strengths.<br /> <br /> No, they chose to go against management 101 and make a huge bet on something they had no experience with, as if they were just a bunch of amateurs. Of course, they did it because they can, not because they're geniuses in the RPG or IP markets, but because they do have money to burn on this project. RPG is, at the end of the day, still a cheap industry with low profits. For a successful video-game company this whole thing is just a pet project. If it goes badly it will hurt, but not kill them.<br /> <br /> Sorry, that's just an ambitious but ultimately childish project that may still go well, but by chance, not due to a well thought strategy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-22T01:59:51-07:00","id":1487461,"title":"","content":"Mind you, Paradox Interactive DOES own Harebrained Schemes that made the awesome Shadow Run games.<br /> <br /> They're even from Seattle.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://harebrained-schemes.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/656fbab12666ec0fae509725/t/693db6b27579f6457cf06fe1/1765652146657/harebrained_web.png?format=1500w\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://harebrained-schemes.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> GRAFT by Harebrained </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://harebrained-schemes.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://harebrained-schemes.com/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-22T02:57:37-07:00","id":1487468,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487211-bloodlines-2-still-exist-according-to-paradox?p=1487461#post1487461\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mind you, Paradox Interactive DOES own Harebrained Schemes that made the awesome Shadow Run games.<br /> <br /> They're even from Seattle.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://harebrained-schemes.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://harebrained-schemes.com/</a></div> </div> </div> </div>And is Harebrained making text heavy flavourful adventures in the WoD IP?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-22T04:19:52-07:00","id":1487471,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487211-bloodlines-2-still-exist-according-to-paradox?p=1487468#post1487468\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And is Harebrained making text heavy flavourful adventures in the WoD IP?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Honestly? I wouldn't mind it, I loved their shadowrun games and such a structure would fit nicely for a vampire game although it would be no bloodlines that's for sure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-22T04:44:31-07:00","id":1487472,"title":"","content":"Personally I feel comfortable assigning blame to Paradox fir v5's development issues. If their intent was to build on the established fansbase they should have interceded a lot earlier on in v5's development cycle. When it became clear Martin was going to try and re-invent the wheel.<br /> <br /> I also suspect they're behind the editions approach to the Sabbat which effectively guaranteed antipathy (if not full blown rage) towards the products you're trying to sell. <br /> <br /> I've also never really been confident in this multi media franchise business model anyway. Frankly even the mcu is beginning to show cracks and I suspect its partly because the comics are shite. Just focus on the product you're making now. Not the battle royal you want to make later on because fortnite is it right now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 07-22-2022, 07:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-22T05:42:59-07:00","id":1487477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Newb95</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487211-bloodlines-2-still-exist-according-to-paradox?p=1487471#post1487471\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly? I wouldn't mind it, I loved their shadowrun games and such a structure would fit nicely for a vampire game although it would be no bloodlines that's for sure.</div> </div> </div> </div>Me too. I think they'd make a good job out of it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-22T08:35:45-07:00","id":1487482,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487211-bloodlines-2-still-exist-according-to-paradox?p=1487461#post1487461\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mind you, Paradox Interactive DOES own Harebrained Schemes that made the awesome Shadow Run games.<br /> <br /> They're even from Seattle.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://harebrained-schemes.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://harebrained-schemes.com/</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, they own a company that made good games that are within this subsidiary's core business. Neat.<br /> <br /> It is as if instead of trying to build their own in-house team to do things the house itself never did (this makes a lot of difference, no matter who are the artists. Management is relevant) and then asking nobodies to do stuff with the IP in the hope that a somebody will decide this is a good idea, they had empowered companies that already do a good job with WoD-style RPGs make the new edition and then asked some of their frigging EIGHT game studios to make WoD games from their own niche styles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-22T12:52:54-07:00","id":1487502,"title":"","content":"It seems relevant to what happened with Bloodlines 2: Paradox has a 1/3 ownership stake in Hardsuit Labs as well...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}